@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@experimentId = EXP001
@runA = replace-with-run-id
@runB = replace-with-run-id

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### List experiments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments

### Get an experiment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{experimentId}}

### Run an experiment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/experiments/{{experimentId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warmupRuns": 3,
  "measuredRuns": 10
}

### List recent runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs

### Get a run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{runA}}

### Get experiment history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/history/{{experimentId}}

### Get the experiment baseline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/baseline/{{experimentId}}

### Compare two runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compare/{{runA}}/{{runB}}

### Get advisor analysis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{runA}}/analysis

### Get execution plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{runA}}/plans

### Missing run example
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/not-a-run
